    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Partners McDonnell are delighted to present No. 42 Grange Village, a beautifully presented and refurbished 3 Bedroom end-of-terrace town residence.\r\nOriginally constructed c.1985, this excellent home has been refurbished throughout in 2026 and is presented in turnkey condition. Recent upgrades include new laminate flooring, fresh internal and external painting, new fascia and soffits, composite front door and a newly refurbished shower room.\r\nThe bright accommodation comprises entrance hall, spacious sitting room with open fireplace, fitted kitchen/dining room with front and rear aspects and direct access to the rear garden. Upstairs are three bedrooms, including two generous double bedrooms, with built-in storage to Bedrooms 1 and 2, together with the newly refurbished shower room.\r\nExternally, the property benefits from a fully walled and newly reseeded rear garden with rear access, plus a separate utility room to the front.\r\nOil-fired central heating throughout.\r\nIdeally located in the popular Grange Village development, within easy reach of Mullingar town centre, schools, shops, restaurants and leisure facilities. Excellent access to the N4 and surrounding road network also makes this an ideal commuter home.\r\nA well presented turnkey property in a popular residential location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "UTILITY ROOM (Accessed from outside front of house)\r\n1.441m x 1.932m \r\nConcrete walls & floors. Window to front aspect. Freshly painted. \r\n\r\nENTRANCE HALL \r\n2.842m x 4.505m \r\nNewly laminated wood flooring. New composite front door. Daydo rail. Radiator.\r\n\r\nSITTING ROOM \r\n4.505m x 3.168m \r\nRear aspect. Newly laminated wooden flooring. Open hearth fireplace with over mantel. Corner Buit-In TV unit and separate display cabinet. Radiator. Centre piece light fitting.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN / DINING ROOM \r\n3.440m x 5.050m \r\nFront & rear aspect. Fully fitted kitchen with wall and floor units with worktop and stainless-steel sink unit. Built-in extractor fan. Newly laminated wood flooring. Wall-mounted air vent. Window overlooking front garden. PVC window and door to rear garden. \r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR \r\nLANDING \r\n1.858m x 3.396m \r\nNewly carpeted stairs and landing. Attic hatch. \r\nHot-press with immersion heater for water. Daylight. \r\n\r\nHOTPRESS\r\n1.039m x 0.861m \r\nAmple built-in shelving. Freshly painted white. \r\n\r\nSHOWER ROOM \r\n1.822m x 2.527m \r\nFront aspect. With W.C., W.H.B. and newly fitted corner shower cubicle with electric shower (Triton T90ER). Wall-mounted extractor fan. Radiator. Privacy window to front. Tiled floor and PVC wall paneling at shower area. \r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1 \r\n3.494m x 2.770m \r\nDouble Bedroom. Rear aspect. Newly laminated wood flooring. Built-in wardrobe and dressing table. Radiator. Wall-mounted air vent. \r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2 \r\n3.105m x 4.033m \r\nDouble bedroom. Rear aspect. Newly laminated wood flooring. Radiator. Built-in wardrobe and dressing table. Wall-mounted air vent. Radiator. Wall mounted air vent.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 3 \r\n2.387m x 3.310m \r\nSmall double bedroom. Front aspect. Newly laminated wooden flooring. Radiator. Wall-mounted air vent. Built-in shelving unit."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "UTILITY ROOM (Accessed from outside front of house) - \r\n1.441m x 1.932m \nConcrete walls & floors. Window to front aspect. Freshly painted. \r\n\r\nENTRANCE HALL - \r\n2.842m x 4.505m \nNewly laminated wood flooring. New composite front door. Daydo rail. Radiator.\n\r\n\r\nSITTING ROOM - \r\n4.505m x 3.168m \nRear aspect. Newly laminated wooden flooring. Open hearth fireplace with over mantel. Corner Buit-In TV unit and separate display cabinet. Radiator. Centre piece light fitting.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN / DINING ROOM - \r\n3.440m x 5.050m \nFront & rear aspect. Fully fitted kitchen with wall and floor units with worktop and stainless-steel sink unit. Built-in extractor fan. Newly laminated wood flooring. Wall-mounted air vent. Window overlooking front garden. PVC window and door to rear garden. \n\r\n\r\nLANDING - \r\n1.858m x 3.396m \nNewly carpeted stairs and landing. Attic hatch. \nHot-press with immersion heater for water. Daylight. \r\n\r\nHOTPRESS - \r\n1.039m x 0.861m \nAmple built-in shelving. Freshly painted white. \r\n\r\nSHOWER ROOM - \r\n1.822m x 2.527m \nFront aspect. With W.C., W.H.B. and newly fitted corner shower cubicle with electric shower (Triton T90ER). Wall-mounted extractor fan. Radiator. Privacy window to front. Tiled floor and PVC wall paneling at shower area. \n\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1 - \r\n3.494m x 2.770m \nDouble Bedroom. Rear aspect. Newly laminated wood flooring. Built-in wardrobe and dressing table. Radiator. Wall-mounted air vent. \r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2 - \r\n3.105m x 4.033m \nDouble bedroom. Rear aspect. Newly laminated wood flooring. Radiator. Built-in wardrobe and dressing table. Wall-mounted air vent. Radiator. Wall mounted air vent.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 3 - \r\n2.387m x 3.310m \nSmall double bedroom. Front aspect. Newly laminated wooden flooring. Radiator. Wall-mounted air vent. Built-in shelving unit. \r\n\r\n"
