        "Content": "• Newly renovated throughout \r\n• New composite front door \r\n• New carpets & laminate wood flooring throughout \r\n• Newly painted internally and externally \r\n• New fascia and soffits \r\n• Newly fitted shower room \r\n• Fully fitted kitchen \r\n• Newly reseeded rear garden, fully walled-in and with rear gate access\r\n• Built-in's in all Bedrooms\r\n• Electric shower \r\n• Immersion water heating\r\nOil Fired Central Heating\r\nConstructed c.1985 and refurbished in 2026"
