      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Google Maps: N91 K2T4\r\n\r\n42 Grange Village is ideally situated on the western side of Mullingar in a mature and popular residential development on the outskirts of town. The property is within easy reach of Mullingar town centre, offering an excellent choice of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, sporting facilities and everyday amenities. Lidl supermarket is just a 3-minute walk away, while the nearby Royal Canal, Greenway and Dog Park provide excellent opportunities for walking, cycling and recreation. The N4 is also easily accessible, making this an excellent location for commuters."
